body:
Missing dependency in useEffect: `currentUser` is used inside the effect (line 68) but is not included in the dependency array (line 75). This can cause stale closures where the reactions mapping uses an outdated `currentUser.id` value.

Add `currentUser` to the dependency array to ensure the effect re-runs when the user changes.
```suggestion
  }, [dataSource, objectName, recordId, currentUser]);
```
